### Datensatz von KI für folgendes gegebenes Szenario erstellt: A palliative care team discusses a patient’s end-of-life plan, but the physician uses medical terminology that the social worker and nurse aren’t familiar with. This lack of clarity causes the nurse to misunderstand the timeline for medication changes and delays initiating pain management Adjustments.

### Aktivität: "Palliativ-Team-Diskussion"
